{"parentUuid":"881bba82-3b92-4823-bbb9-c1673e51977d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgX1pVm9JTtbDKFUBDdek","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 290 open AIKit ideas now have a recorded decision, and the register validates.\n\n| Decision | Count |\n|---|---|\n| Approved | 4 |\n| Deferred | 234 (each names the condition that would justify revisiting it) |\n| Rejected | 39 (25 already built, 14 with nothing in AIKit that would use them) |\n| Superseded | 16 (merged into another idea) |\n\nThe earlier pass adopted 53 ideas. I kept 4 and deferred 41, because neither the code nor the fix history showed the problem those ideas guard against. AIKit already runs 19 principles, 279 ADRs and 727 budgeted tests, so a new gate needs evidence that it's needed.\n\n**Approved:**\n1. **IDEA-406, command and reference linter.** It comes with a real bug: idea-catcher's next-step and fix hints tell you to run `python tools/idea_catcher.py …` in about ten places, for example in [idea_catcher/registry.py:812](idea_catcher/registry.py#L812). There is no `tools/` directory; the working commands are `python idea_catcher.py` or `python aikit.py idea-catcher`. IDEA-054 is merged into this one.\n2. **IDEA-398, marked-block edits to user-owned files.** Three past fixes were regenerated output overwriting your content (REUSE annotations, the UI identifier check date, a README rewrite). README media sections already use these markers; extend them to every generator that edits user-owned files. IDEA-620 is merged into this one.\n3. **IDEA-262, size-drop guard before commit.** It would have caught the README rewrite regression before it was committed.\n4. **IDEA-005, a digest view of the codebase map.** The map is 2,275 lines (150 KB), far past AIKit's own 100-line read and 16k-character payload rules. IDEA-044 is merged into this one.\n\n**Earlier adopts I deferred, with the evidence:**\n- **ADR-locator gate (199):** all 279 ADRs exist and nothing cites a missing one.\n- **Anchor checker (510):** only one tracked Markdown link uses a `#` anchor.\n- **Debt baseline ratchet (036):** neurocore, lattice and tally pass the hygiene scan with zero findings.\n- **Directory-sync outcome (138):** `fsync_dir` does nothing on Windows, the main platform here.\n- **Plan-scope gate (214):** PRINCIPLE-007 already forbids changes outside the plan.\n\n**Earlier adopts I rejected:**\n- **Archive intake contract (365):** AIKit never extracts archives.\n- **Reserved command names (375):** nothing can add a command to the CLI.\n- **Credential indirection (483):** reading the key from the environment already is that indirection.\n\nThe `tools/` path bug is recorded on IDEA-406 (Approved, P1). AIKit has no `IDEAS.md`-style backlog file, so the register is its only record. I didn't fix it. It's a one-line string change in each of the ~10 places, plus a test, if you want it done now.\n\nNothing was committed. The register is git-ignored, and a backup from before this run is at `C:\\Users\\YUNUS-~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\c--Users-Yunus-Emre-Desktop-portable-agent-kit\\05aa96e5-db7a-4aed-bad4-f0f3cebd2787\\scratchpad\\ideas.before-aikit.json`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_read_input_tokens":209431,"output_tokens":1252,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":89},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1252,"cache_read_input_tokens":209431,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management