le ablation: valuable at a model change; revisit when the default model changes and capsules may be stale.\",\n    \"220\": \"Harness checklist gate: most items are already principles; revisit for items not yet gated.\",\n    \"222\": \"Gate taxonomy: gates are pre-flight by nature; revisit if a revision loop without a cap appears.\",\n    \"224\": \"Predicate context: principles are cited by ID already; revisit if briefs paraphrase rules wrongly.\",\n    \"225\": \"Tests-only auditor: the tester role writes tests; revisit if it edits implementation.\",\n    \"226\": \"Requirement coverage: revisit if a milestone ships without the requirement it named.\",\n    \"228\": \"History vs liveness split: ledger holds both but is tiny; revisit if heartbeats are added.\",\n    \"229\": \"Cross-provider review: delegate can run a reviewer on another provider; revisit to record the SHA \"\n           \"when that becomes routine.\",\n    \"231\": \"Deletion tombstones: AIKit deletes only temp buffers (clean); revisit if state files are ever garbage-collected.\",\n    \"232\": \"Ledger export: every host already reads the same files; revisit if another tool must import AIKit state.\",\n    \"235\": \"Skill eval harness: one skill; revisit when skills multiply.\",\n    \"236\": \"Third-party skill scanner: no skill intake path; revisit if skills are installed from outside.\",\n    \"238\": \"Contract-keyed regeneration: generation is fast; revisit if regeneration becomes slow or model-based.\",\n    \"239\": \"Staged candidates: media candidates already await review before apply; revisit for other generators.\",\n    \"241\": \"Narrow storage interfaces: state helpers are shared functions; revisit if a second backend is needed.\",\n    \"242\": \"Persona reviewers: revisit if single-reviewer audits miss doc defects.\",\n    \"243\": \"Design drift report: architecture.md is prose; revisit with IDEA-300.\",\n    \"244\": \"Brief-to-draft gate: revisit if large features start without an approved design.\",\n    \"245\": \"Multi-host plugin: AIKit syncs eight hosts by files; revisit if users want one-command install.\",\n    \"247\": \"Append-only ledger: ledgers are 10–19 KB, so whole-file rewrites are cheap; revisit above ~1 MB.\",\n    \"254\": \"Learning capture: `aikit guideline --source user` records user rules; revisit if corrections are lost.\",\n    \"256\": \"STOP file: `reforge stop` covers the only long loop; revisit if another loop is added.\",\n    \"258\": \"Touched-surface audits: revisit when an optional audit (publish, media) is skipped and breaks.\",\n    \"259\": \"Core regression tier: the full suite is fast enough; revisit if the inner loop slows.\",\n    \"261\": \"Optional capability registry: subcommands are the registry; revisit if optional features multiply.\",\n    \"263\": \"Plan fits context: revisit if a milestone fails from context exhaustion.\",\n    \"264\": \"Instruction compile lint: sync_principles --check validates schema; revisit with IDEA-406.\",\n    \"271\": \"Strict reference resolution: revisit if a typo in a gate or principle id is silently dropped.\",\n    \"273\": \"Plan attestation: PRINCIPLE-004 makes the ledger plan authoritative after compaction; revisit if an agent \"\n           \"acts on a reconstructed plan.\",\n    \"274\": \"Worker journal: subagents report through their final message; revisit if findings get lost.\",\n    \"275\": \"Environment doctor: `aikit fix`, --audit and status cover it; revisit if environment failures go undiagnosed.\",\n    \"280\": \"Local overlay: `aikit guideline` writes tracked rules on purpose; revisit if machine-specific rules leak in.\",\n    \"281\": \"Truncation contract: revisit if a gate failure tail cuts the line that explains it.\",\n    \"290\": \"Trace learning loop: revisit when transcripts are collected systematically.\",\n    \"296\": \"Reuse table: PRINCIPLE-003 R2 requires a call-site grep; revisit with IDEA-005's reuse digest.\",\n    \"297\