ting backups: one .bak plus git; revisit if a double failed rewrite loses state.\",\n    \"450\": \"Executable handoff: revisit if subagent output is accepted without checks.\",\n    \"452\": \"Closed predicate interpreter: needed only if IDEA-200 conditions become executable.\",\n    \"457\": \"Step-verifier registry: revisit if gates need per-phase verifiers.\",\n    \"474\": \"Sketch-first plans: revisit if detailed plans churn.\",\n    \"475\": \"Typed drift catalogue: `aikit fix` repairs known drift; revisit if repairs need typing.\",\n    \"476\": \"Constant return fields: revisit if an always-constant field misleads a caller.\",\n    \"477\": \"Observed vs prepared labels: revisit if reports claim observations they did not make.\",\n    \"478\": \"Capability status map: revisit if generated inventories are read as support claims.\",\n    \"480\": \"Non-claims section: revisit when README is next restructured.\",\n    \"481\": \"Explicit-invocation skills: host behaviour; revisit if the skill auto-triggers wrongly.\",\n    \"486\": \"Provenance stamps: revisit if dossier facts go stale unnoticed (revalidate exists).\",\n    \"489\": \"Contribution template: no outside contributors yet; revisit when there are.\",\n    \"492\": \"Bounded provider backoff: revisit if upstream_check waits too long.\",\n    \"493\": \"MCP tool contract: AIKit exposes no MCP server; revisit if one is planned.\",\n    \"496\": \"Ephemeral prompts: delegate passes the brief as the message; revisit if prompts are staged on disk.\",\n    \"498\": \"Repo risk screen: idea-catcher reads untrusted checkouts; revisit with IDEA-412 if a hostile repo is reviewed.\",\n    \"501\": \"Sandboxed fetch: revisit if idea-catcher starts downloading artefacts beyond upstream headers.\",\n    \"502\": \"Passed/info rows: revisit if a silently skipped check is mistaken for a pass.\",\n    \"503\": \"Capability-gated repair routing: reforge routes by rule already; revisit if a fix is applied where it cannot work.\",\n    \"505\": \"Single version source: no conflicting version strings found; revisit when versions are documented.\",\n    \"510\": \"Anchor computation: one anchor link in tracked Markdown; revisit if anchors become common.\",\n    \"512\": \"URL dedup: revisit if duplicate dossiers appear for one repo.\",\n    \"514\": \"Structural validator: revisit if README sections go missing or empty.\",\n    \"517\": \"ADR graph: 2 Superseded of 279; revisit if supersession grows.\",\n    \"522\": \"Release manifest: AIKit has no releases; revisit if it starts tagging releases.\",\n    \"523\": \"Generated path policy: generators write fixed paths; revisit if a generator writes caller-chosen paths.\",\n    \"524\": \"Retired-ID contract: revisit if principles or gate ids are renumbered.\",\n    \"525\": \"Override declarations: project guidelines add, never override; revisit if projects need overrides.\",\n    \"529\": \"Target envelope: revisit if AIKit acts on systems it does not own.\",\n    \"532\": \"Flakiness detector: revisit if a test is seen alternating.\",\n    \"535\": \"Follow-on objective: --suspend and new tasks cover continuation; revisit if follow-ups are lost.\",\n    \"536\": \"Differential suite: revisit when an optimisation replaces a trusted implementation.\",\n    \"540\": \"Plan archive: revisit if past plans are needed to explain code shape.\",\n    \"544\": \"Verification posture: `aikit fix` reports a missing test command; revisit for projects without tests.\",\n    \"546\": \"Virtual time: revisit if time-dependent logic needs unit tests without sleeps.\",\n    \"547\": \"Graph assertions: revisit if a declared dependency graph is added.\",\n    \"548\": \"Expected denials: revisit if a denial silently stops firing.\",\n    \"551\": \"Precedence provenance: revisit on a wrong-source setting bug.\",\n    \"552\": \"Read-once context artefact: revisit if project context files drift.\",\n    \"554\": \"Manifest parity: revisit if a manifest lists skills or roles that do not exist.\",\n    \"555\": \"Trigger collisions: one skill; revisit as skills grow.\",\n    \"556\": \"Inconclusive exit: exit 2 is already usage error (PRINCIPLE-011); revisit if a gate passes when it could not run.\",\n    \"558\": \"Guardrail disclosure: revisit if scans adapt to defences.\",\n    \"560\": \"Failure-to-tool routing: revisit when choosing test tooling.\",\n    \"561\": \"Vendor evidence checklist: revisit for dossiers on tool vendors.\",\n    \"564\": \"Hermetic call fixtures: revisit if AIKit gains model calls to test.\",\n    \"566\": \"Score-drop comparison: revisit if scored evaluations are added.\",\n    \"567\": \"Incomplete count: revisit with IDEA-556.\",\n    \"568\": \"Bug diary: fix commits plus tests cover it; revisit if root causes are lost.\",\n    \"577\": \"Failure-classified fallback: revisit if a fallback runs after a permission error.\",\n    \"579\": \"Recovery ledger: revisit if substitutions happen.\",\n    \"582\": \"Single-writer: the ledger lock serialises writers; revisit if a lost claim is observed.\",\n    \"583\": \"Execution-mode refusal: revisit if AIKit gains container/local modes.\",\n    \"596\": \"Not-certifiable outcome: revisit with IDEA-556.\",\n    \"597\": \"Failure reduction: revisit when a long failing transcript must be minimised.\",\n    \"598\": \"Socket egress denial: unit tests make no network calls by rule; revisit if one does.\",\n    \"600\": \"Authorization scope: PRINCIPLE-018 R1 authorizes pushes; revisit if a side effect runs unauthorized.\",\n    \"602\": \"Twin parity: no twin implementations; revisit if a shell and Python version of one tool appear.\",\n    \"611\": \"Finished review pass: revisit if done tasks keep needing polish.\",\n    \"615\": \"Status schema version: revisit if `status --json` consumers break.\",\n    \"617\": \"Shadow guidance revision: revisit with IDEA-217.\",\n    \"618\": \"Toolchain manifest: revisit if a gate fails for a missing