it too.\n- **Cross-principle check**: no principle section changed. Serves PRINCIPLE-003 (a printed command is grounded in a real file), PRINCIPLE-005 (documented commands resolve), PRINCIPLE-011 R6 (a `Fix:` line must work) and PRINCIPLE-016 (the knowledge check owns reference integrity).\nEOF\npython scripts/update_knowledge_base.py --check 2>&1 | grep -E \"FAIL|README|ADR IDs\"; python -c \"print(len(open('README.md',encoding='utf-8').read()))\"","description":"Append ADR-280 and recheck knowledge and README","timeout":180000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":326237,"output_tokens":1208,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1208,"cache_read_input_tokens":326237,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01L5SdvHtUz3qbUiSQm2XxvA":{"command":"cd \"C:/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit\"; tail -c 200 knowledge/decisions.md | od -c | tail -3; cat >> knowledge/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n\n### ADR-280: Every `python <path>.py` in AIKit Names an Existing File\n- **Date**: 2026-10-29\n- **Status**: Accepted\n- **Context**: ADR-252 removed the standalone Idea Catcher and its `tools/` facades, but ten Idea Catcher messages (the stale-MATRIX error, five `next:` hints, two help texts, a CONCEPTS.md footer and an import comment) still told users to run `python tools/idea_catcher.py`, which no longer exists. The README gate checks on