{"parentUuid":"41a0c85e-024e-47e6-903b-11882042643c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a96664c9-b051-4537-af91-e4f15164d542","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015GaSLFuYtcdvYrhQ2Cy9Qn","type":"tool_result","content":"120\t---\n121\t\n122\t## 🛠️ Phase 3: Implementation & Synchronization\n123\t\n124\t### 1. Synchronize Principles & IDE Instructions\n125\tAfter modifying `GUIDELINES.md` or `.agents/rules/domain.md`, update all 8 host client instruction files and README:\n126\t```bash\n127\tpython scripts/sync_principles.py\n128\t```\n129\t- Verify zero budget violations (<1,750 tokens per target):\n130\t```bash\n131\tpython scripts/sync_principles.py --check\n132\t```\n133\t\n134\t### 2. Synchronize AST Codebase Map & Knowledge Base\n135\tAfter creating or refactoring symbols:\n136\t```bash\n137\tpython scripts/update_knowledge_base.py\n138\t```\n139\t- Verify link integrity and codebase map freshness:\n140\t```bash\n141\tpython scripts/update_knowledge_base.py --check\n142\t```\n143\t\n144\t### 3. Subagent Delegation via OpenCode (PRINCIPLE-012 R8)\n145\tDelegate bulk token-heavy work to free or local subagents using headless non-interactive mode:\n146\t```bash\n147\t# High-speed grep and symbol exploration\n148\topencode run --standalone --format json --agent explorer \"<query>\"\n149\t\n150\t# Architecture & deep reasoning (SWE-bench 49.2%)\n151\topencode run --standalone --format json --agent architect \"<prompt>\"\n152\t\n153\t# High-fidelity code refactoring (SWE-bench 39.8%)\n154\topencode run --standalone --format json --agent coder --file <target> \"<prompt>\"\n155\t\n156\t# Automated test creation and regression verification\n157\topencode run --standalone --format json --agent tester --file <test_file> \"<prompt>\"\n158\t\n159\t# Documentation, link and claim-fidelity audit\n160\topencode run --standalone --format json --agent reviewer \"<audit_prompt>\"\n161\t\n162\t# Offline / Air-gapped code generation via local Ollama\n163\topencode run --standalone --format json --agent coder --model ollama/qwen2.5-coder:latest --auto \"<prompt>\"\n164\t```\n165\t*(Subagents MUST NOT write to the ledger; only the root orchestrator writes checkpoints).*\n166\t\n167\t---\n168\t\n169\t## 🔒 Phase 4: Verification Gate Shield (Pre-Commit Delivery Triad)\n170\t\n171\tBefore committing any Track B or Track C changes, ALL gates must pass:"}]},"uuid":"3e30ee41-1ec3-4f47-9278-5a5c025b1b97","timestamp":"2026-10-29T19:30:17.425Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"c:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\.agents\\skills\\aikit\\SKILL.md","content":"---\n\n## 🛠️ Phase 3: Implementation & Synchronization\n\n### 1. Synchronize Principles & IDE Instructions\nAfter modifying `GUIDELINES.md` or `.agents/rules/domain.md`, update all 8 host client instruction files and README:\n```bash\npython scripts/sync_principles.py\n```\n- Verify zero budget violations (<1,750 tokens per target):\n```bash\npython scripts/sync_principles.py --check\n```\n\n### 2. Synchronize AST Codebase Map & Knowledge Base\nAfter creating or refactoring symbols:\n```bash\npython scripts/update_knowledge_base.py\n```\n- Verify link integrity and codebase map freshness:\n```bash\npython scripts/update_knowledge_base.py --check\n```\n\n### 3. Subagent Delegation via OpenCode (PRINCIPLE-012 R8)\nDelegate bulk token-heavy work to free or local subagents using headless non-interactive mode:\n```bash\n# High-speed grep and symbol exploration\nopencode run --standalone --format json --agent explorer \"<query>\"\n\n# Architecture & deep reasoning (SWE-bench 49.2%)\nopencode run --standalone --format json --agent architect \"<prompt>\"\n\n# High-fidelity code refactoring (SWE-bench 39.8%)\nopencode run --standalone --format json --agent coder --file <target> \"<prompt>\"\n\n# Automated test creation and regression verification\nopencode run --standalone --format json --agent tester --file <test_file> \"<prompt>\"\n\n# Documentation, link and claim-fidelity audit\nopencode run --standalone --format json --agent reviewer \"<audit_prompt>\"\n\n# Offline / Air-gapped code generation via local Ollama\nopencode run --standalone --format json --agent coder --model ollama/qwen2.5-coder:latest --auto \"<prompt>\"\n```\n*(Subagents MUST NOT write to the ledger; only the root orchestrator writes checkpoints).*\n\n---\n\n## 🔒 Phase 4: Verification Gate Shield (Pre-Commit Delivery Triad)\n\nBefore committing any Track B or Track C changes, ALL gates must pass:","numLines":52,"startLine":120,"totalLines":233}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"41a0c85e-024e-47e6-903b-11882042643c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit","sessionId":"05aa96e5-db7a-4aed-bad4-f0f3cebd2787","version":"2.1.312","gitBranch":"main"}
