ted commands.*\r","+\r","+**Size**: `84` lines (`4237` bytes)\r","+\r","+**Classes:**\r","+- `class FakeLLM`\r","+  - Method `.__init__(content)`\r","+  - Method `async def .chat_completion(messages, **_kwargs)`\r","+\r","+**Functions:**\r","+- `def reply(text, *commands)`\r","+- `def test_a_reply_is_parsed_from_json_fences_or_plain_text_and_commands_are_allow_listed()`\r","+- `async def test_suggest_mode_returns_commands_without_running_them(tmp_path)`\r","+- `async def test_autonomous_mode_runs_the_commands_and_journals_them(tmp_path)`\r","+- `async def test_set_goal_writes_a_goal_through_the_memory_store(tmp_path, monkeypatch)`\r","+- `def test_chat_and_command_routes(tmp_path, monkeypatch)`\r","+\r","+---\r","+\r"," ### [`tests/test_brain_configuration.py`](tests/test_brain_configuration.py)\r"," > *Policy-gated self-configuration: preview, apply, rollback and quotas.*\r"," \r"]},{"oldStart":4113,"oldLines":11,"newStart":4193,"newLines":13,"lines":[" ### [`tests/test_brain_ui.py`](tests/test_brain_ui.py)\r"," > *Brain dashboard route and navigation.*\r"," \r","-**Size**: `24` lines (`645` bytes)\r","+**Size**: `39` lines (`1373` bytes)\r"," \r"," **Functions:**\r"," - `def test_brain_dashboard_renders()`\r"," - `def test_brain_dashboard_is_linked_from_navbar()`\r","+- `def test_the_brain_page_has_the_mode_switch_chat_and_action_journal()`\r","+- `def test_a_disabled_brain_stays_in_the_navbar_and_enables_on_click()`\r"," \r"," ---\r"," \r"]}]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\neurocore\\.aikit\\decisions.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1462,"oldLines":3,"newStart":1462,"newLines":41,"lines":["   signal to the model, not a guarantee; the guardrail scans remain the enforcement.\r"," - Cross-principle check: no principle section changed. Serves PRINCIPLE-019 (untrusted input stays\r","   distinguishable) and PRINCIPLE-003 (the change sits at the single exit every model call uses).\r","+\r","+### ADR-067: The brain can act autonomously and be talked to from its page\r","+- **Date**: 2026-10-30\r","+- **Status**: Accepted\r","+- **Context**: The operator asked for a Brain section to start the brain and interact with it, with\r","+  chat plus structured control, and for the brain to act autonomously. The `/brain/ui` dashboard\r","+  (ADR-032) could start, stop and inspect the brain but offered no conversation, the navbar hid it\r","+  while the opt-in module (ADR-036) was off, and `set_mode` refused anything beyond\r","+  observe/suggest. ADR-028 had already built the kernel, ADR-041 the goal link and ADR-046 the\r","+  daily self-budget as the rails autonomy would need.\r","+- **Decision**:\r","+  1. A third mode, `autonomous`. Its cycles generate proposals as `suggest` does and then, outside\r","+     the state lock, act on pending proposals that have an entry in `AUTONOMOUS_ACTIONS`\r","+     (`modules/brain/autonomy.py`): record a baseline (only through `promote_baseline`, which\r","+     refuses anything below a perfect run), review a failing evaluation, consolidate learning,\r","+     check recall. Each action needs `kernel.can_run_autonomy()` and one unit of its self-budget\r","+     kind; at most `max_autonomous_actions_per_cycle` (default 2) run per cycle; every attempt is\r","+     journaled in `state.actions` (newest first, 50 kept) with actor, status and result. SAFE\r","+     kernel still forces `observe`. No tool, flow or outbound action is reachable; outbound tools\r","+     stay drafts (ADR-064).\r","+  2. `modules/brain/conversation.py`: `POST /brain/chat` sends the message with a bounded view of\r","+     the live state and asks for JSON `{reply, commands}`; at most three commands, only from\r","+     `COMMANDS` (the autonomous actions plus `run_cycle`, `run_evaluation`, `set_goal`). In\r","+     autonomous mode they run as `brain:chat` and are journaled; otherwise they return as\r","+     suggestions that `POST /brain/commands` runs for the requesting actor. History is kept in\r","+     `data/brain_chat.json` (100 messages, ledger lock, atomic write). Goal text passes the memory\r","+     guardrail (ADR-065).\r","+  3. `/brain/ui` gains a mode switch, a chat panel with Run buttons for suggestions and a journal;\r","+     the navbar always shows Brain, and while the module is off the link enables it and opens the\r","+     page, so opting in stays one deliberate click.\r","+- **Consequences**: The brain can now maintain its own evaluation baseline and learning without a\r","+  person, bounded per cycle and per day; everything it does is visible in its journal. A model that\r","+  answers with anything but the allow-listed commands can only talk. Proposals that need a person\r","+  (provider repair, flow activation, memory seeding) still wait. The chat needs the configured LLM;\r","+  without one it returns 502 with Why/Fix.\r","+- Cross-principle check: no principle section changed. Serves PRINCIPLE-013 (journal and history\r","+  are written atomically under a lock), PRINCIPLE-019 (no path from chat to tools or outbound\r","+  actions) and PRINCIPLE-011 R6 (every refusal carries Why/Fix).\r"]}]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\neurocore\\modules\\autonomous_agent\\module.json","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":15,"newStart":1,"newLines":15,"lines":["-{","-  \"name\": \"Autonomous Agent\",","-  \"id\": \"autonomous_agent\",","-  \"description\": \"Self-governing AI agent with sandboxed execution, dynamic flow creation, memory, reflection, and user communication\",","-  \"enabled\": false,","-  \"order\": 100,","-  \"icon\": \"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 17h-2v-2h2v2zm2.07-7.75l-.9.92C13.45 12.9 13 13.5 13 15h-2v-.5c0-1.1.45-2.1 1.17-2.83l1.24-1.26c.37-.36.59-.86.59-1.41 0-1.1-.9-2-2-2s-2 .9-2 2H8c0-2.21 1.79-4 4-4s4 1.79 4 4c0 .88-.36 1.68-.93 2.25z\",","-  \"is_flow_node\": false,","-  \"config\": {","-    \"agent_config_path\": \"modules/autonomous_agent