ojects/*/.aikit/reforge.reviews/*.md (unfenced hunks); reforge/review.py:7 treats only the answer as untrusted\"),\n    \"705\": (R, HOST), \"908\": (R, HOST + \" The capability-typed flow idea fits neurocore's IDEA-058 policy engine instead.\"),\n    \"912\": (D, \"Deferred with IDEA-493: AIKit exposes and consumes no MCP or tool servers to audit.\"),\n    \"706\": (S, \"Hash-chained, HMAC-signed audit entries are the IDEA-212 ledger chain.\", \"212\"),\n    \"708\": (S, \"An integrity manifest for rules is IDEA-147's base-held trust manifest.\", \"147\"),\n    \"879\": (S, \"A signed rule bundle is IDEA-147's base-held trust manifest.\", \"147\"),\n    \"880\": (S, \"Undefined-outcome refusal is IDEA-556's tri-state exit (inconclusive never passes).\", \"556\"),\n    \"911\": (S, \"An injection regression suite is IDEA-412's adversarial corpus.\", \"412\"),\n    \"754\": (S, \"Token-budgeted context with fetch substitution is what IDEA-210 shipped: an index plus topic files read on demand.\", \"210\"),\n    \"707\": (R, \"Rejected: no consumer. AIKit runs for one operator; agents are named in the ledger (--agent) and a DID, keys and sponsors would protect nothing.\"),\n    \"710\": (R, \"Already implemented: sync_principles renders every TIER1_TARGETS host and tests assert parity (see IDEA-260).\"),\n    \"813\": (R, \"Already implemented: GUIDELINES.md is the constitution and the five-phase lifecycle with checkpoints is the phase pipeline.\"),\n    \"771\": (R, TEMPORAL), \"773\": (R, TEMPORAL),\n    \"878\": (R, \"Rejected: no consumer. AIKit has no policy language whose evaluation could be partially precomputed.\"),\n    \"709\": (D, \"Deferred with IDEA-955/437: rules are checked by sync_principles --check; revisit when a rule is found unenforced.\"),\n    \"955\": (D, \"Deferred: overlaps IDEA-437/548; revisit when a gate is found to have silently stopped firing.\"),\n    \"881\": (D, \"Deferred with IDEA-955: revisit when principle-level coverage is requested.\"),\n    \"969\": (D, \"Mostly covered: sync_principles --check enforces the Tier 1 budget and capsules are generated in a fixed order; revisit if a critical rule is ignored by agents.\"),\n    \"751\": (D, LEDGER), \"774\": (D, LEDGER), \"772\": (D, \"Deferred with IDEA-305: --reset abandons a whole task; revisit if a partial reset is needed.\"),\n    \"752\": (D, CEREMONY), \"755\": (D, CEREMONY), \"877\": (D, CEREMONY),\n    \"753\": (D, \"Partly covered: verify_commit uses a throwaway worktree and reforge refuses dirty targets; revisit if a command writes outside its project.\"),\n    \"775\": (D, \"Deferred: AIKit's outbound calls are upstream_check and delegate; revisit if a dead endpoint stalls a gate.\"),\n    \"814\": (D, \"Deferred with IDEA-551: rule precedence is fixed (principles over project guidelines); revisit on a precedence bug.\"),\n    \"815\": (D, \"Deferred with IDEA-110: host paths live in one table (TIER1_TARGETS); revisit if host logic outgrows it.\"),\n    \"816\": (D, \"Deferred with IDEA-105/255: runtime hooks are reachable only on hosts with hooks (.claude/settings.json).\"),\n    \"817\": (D, \"Deferred: AIKit has no component distribution (IDEA-386/387).\"),\n    \"910\": (D, \"Deferred: per-change --risks covers surfaces in prose; revisit when AIKit gains a network or tool surface.\"),\n    \"943\": (D, \"Deferred: valuable but costly; revisit if a gate regression passes the existing tests.\"),\n    \"944\": (D, \"Deferred: line-ending and path differences have caused one real fix (6260bbb, license sync); revisit if another verdict changes with CRLF/LF or a path.\"),\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016kGCK8BhmRDcNFyJgr7XEH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"C:/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit\"; S=\"C:/Users/YUNUS-~1/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/c--Users-Yunus-Emre-Desktop-portable-agent-kit/05aa96e5-db7a-4aed-bad4-f0f3cebd2787/scratchpad\"; python \"$S/apply_verdicts.py\" \"$S/v_aikit