ore(reforge): record run-1 stages 10-11\n9cc2235 chore(ledger): complete superseded read-only guard\ne2d6849 fix(claims): keep superseded claims read-only\n33ecaf5 chore(ledger): complete integrity guards\nf2f657f fix(claims): guard failed verdicts and new-test bypass","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"363f4307-cd12-4f34-9aa8-1b943fc56ba9","timestamp":"2026-10-30T12:33:45.762Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Research Engine\nA falsification-first research engine for provenance-backed claims, executable kill tests and auditable verdicts.\n## ⚡ 30-Second Cold-Start Quick Reference\n- **Runtime Prerequisites**: Python 3.10+; standard library only, no network or third-party packages.\n- **Canonical Regression Shield Gate**:\n  ```bash\n  python -m unittest discover -s tests -t .\n  ```\n- **Try every mechanic in 10 seconds**:\n  ```bash\n  python -m engine demo\n  python -m engine check\n  python -m engine report r_000001\n  ```\n  `demo` builds a labelled synthetic program and makes no scientific claim.\n- **Start a real program**: see [Commands](#commands) for `research`, `question`, `source` and\n  `claim add`.\n### 🛠️ AIKit Commands (run from the AIKit folder)\n| Role | Command |\n|---|---|\n| Status, task and gates | `python aikit.py status research-engine` |\n| Phase 4: every gate | `python aikit.py check research-engine` |\n| Repair memory and map, then check | `python aikit.py fix research-engine` |\n| Resume an interrupted task | `python aikit.py resume research-engine` |\n## Why this is not \"just lattice\"\nASSETS.md\nCOMMERCIAL.md\nLICENSE\nLICENSES\nREADME.md\nREUSE.toml\nassets\ndocs\nengine\nresearch.db\ntests\n__init__.py\n__main__.py\n__pycache__\nanalysis.py\nartifacts.py\nattempts.py\nbundle.py\ncalibration.py\ncascade.py\nclaims.py\ncli.py\ncontext.py\ndatabase.py\ndemo.py\ndiffing.py\nduplicates.py\nerrors.py\nevents.py\nevidence.py\nhypotheses.py\ninformation.py\nintegrity.py\nkilltests.py\nmaintenance.py\nmanifest.py\nmarkdown.py\nmerging.py\nmodels.py\no