ive llama.cpp GGUF parser is a magic-number test, on files that can \"\n                \"come from any download or import; bound header counts and lengths before parsing.\", \"\",\n            \"src/model-registry.js:13,66,156,246\"),\n    \"862\": (A, \"P2: catalog downloads follow redirects and are verified only by final byte count; add a SHA-256 per catalog \"\n                \"entry and verify before promotion. Absorbs IDEA-886.\", \"\", \"src/downloader.js:140-172\"),\n    \"886\": (S, \"ETag/size-bound verification is IDEA-862's content-hash check.\", \"862\"),\n    \"925\": (D, \"Deferred: chunk-level Merkle verification after IDEA-862's whole-file hash; revisit if resumed downloads corrupt.\"),\n    \"882\": (D, \"Deferred: one process owns downloads today; revisit if concurrent downloads of one file become possible.\"),\n    \"1016\": (D, \"Deferred: downloads go to curated catalog hosts; revisit with IDEA-995 when arbitrary Hugging Face URIs are accepted.\"),\n    \"1018\": (D, \"Deferred: model delete already requires an API key once auth is on; revisit with IDEA-1054 for an explicit phrase.\"),\n    \"924\": (D, \"Deferred: a per-launch capability token complements IDEA-1054; revisit after LAN/CORS require auth.\"),\n    \"938\": (D, \"Deferred: a signed catalog needs key management; revisit after IDEA-862 adds hashes.\"),\n    \"1015\": (R, NOTOOLS), \"942\": (R, NOTOOLS),\n    \"859\": (D, \"Deferred: response_format is ignored today; revisit when API clients ask for JSON mode.\"),\n    \"874\": (S, \"Same JSON-schema constrained decoding as IDEA-859.\", \"859\"),\n    \"865\": (D, \"Deferred: a second request gets 409 today; revisit a bounded queue if API clients collide.\"),\n    \"872\": (S, \"A slot-based queue is IDEA-865's bounded queue.\", \"865\"),\n    \"904\": (D, PERF), \"953\": (S, \"Draft pairing with autotune is IDEA-904's speculative decoding.\", \"904\"),\n    \"941\": (D, PERF), \"1043\": (D, PERF), \"905\": (D, PERF), \"940\": (D, P