0c4d) fingerprints the effective system prompt, the \"\n                \"exact bounded history, the prompt, settings and model identity with SHA-256 (src/generation-manifest.js).\"),\n    \"858\": (R, \"Already implemented: Context overflow offers shift (context shift) and strict, and strict refuses with a \"\n               \"token-counted 413 context_overflow (src/engine.js:412-420, 583-591).\"),\n    \"1018\": (R, \"Already covered: the UI asks for confirmation before deleting a model or revoking a key (askConfirm), and \"\n                \"since ADR-018 the delete routes are same-origin only and need a key from other machines.\"),\n    \"968\": (S, \"The Host/Origin checks are IDEA-1054's fix (ADR-018: cross-site refusal and loopback Host on loopback \"\n               \"sockets).\", \"1054\"),\n    \"924\": (D, \"Deferred: after ADR-018 a per-launch token adds little; revisit if another local program is found driving the API.\"),\n    \"1024\": (D, \"Partly implemented: acquireHomeLock gives one process per home folder (src/fs-atomic.js:130); revisit graceful drain on shutdown.\"),\n    \"859\": (D, \"Partly implemented: JSON and JSON-schema constrained output exist as app settings (engine #grammarFor); \"\n               \"revisit per-request response_format when /v1 clients need it.\"),\n    \"954\": (D, \"Partly covered: presets warn about the measured Q4 KV regression (8b3a0be); revisit a budget contract with IDEA-903.\"),\n    \"855\": (D, \"Partly implemented: GET /v1/models/{id} returns quant, size and chat-template hash (e468a33); revisit full provenance.\"),\n    \"1031\": (D, \"Partly covered: catalog cards show each model's license; revisit an acceptance ledger if a gated license is added.\"),\n}\n\n\ndef main() -> int:\n    root = registry.default_root()\n    for k, row in V.items():\n        status, reason = row[0], row[1]\n        sup = f\"IDEA-{row[2]}\" if len(row) > 2 and row[2] else \"\"\n        evidence = row[3] if len(row) > 3 else \"\"\n        registry.set_status(root, f\"IDEA-{k}\", status=status, reason=reason, decided_by=BY,\n                            superseded_by=sup, evidence=evidence)\n        registry.set_tags(root, f\"IDEA-{k}\", add=[\"revised\"], by=BY,\n                          reason=\"second pass over deferred ideas against current code\")\n    print(\"applied\", len(V))\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2218,"cache_read_input_tokens":155547,"output_tokens":2024,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":70},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2218,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2024,"cache_read_input_tokens":155547,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2218,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2218},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013xEVLBSk66ny7doounWvgw":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\YUNUS-~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\c--Users-Yunus-Emre-Desktop-portable-agent-kit\\05aa96e5-db7a-4aed-bad4-f0f3cebd2787\\scratchpad\\v_modelduck_pass2.py","content":"\"\"\"Second pass over modelduck's Deferred ideas: only the verdicts that change.\"\"\"\nimport sys\n\nsys.path.insert(0, r\"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\")\nfrom idea_catcher import registry  # noqa: E402\n\nBY = \"claude:idea-review\"\nA, D, R, S = \"Approved\", \"Deferred\", \"Rejected\", \"Superseded\"\nV = {\n    \"882\": (A, \"P1 DATA INTEGRITY (re-checked, narrowed): DownloadManager.start never refuses a second active job for \"\n               \"the same catalog id,