{"parentUuid":"b8d01aea-99e8-46d7-97db-c666557f1739","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"70a75a41-7888-4c77-bc13-5ad4f9e80b7c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0194NKVSqUtwjL1Gh8vNinM6","type":"tool_result","content":"## AI benchmark gate\n\nToken speed alone is not enough. ModelDuck ships a deterministic two-phase\nbenchmark that runs the real `LlamaEngine`:\n\n1. **Model reload phase** (`npm run bench:model`) compares model files,\n   quantization, KV cache, context size, batch size, thread pool, sequences,\n| Candidate | Quality | Speed | Memory |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Qwen2.5 Coder 1.5B Q4 | 95.2% | 22.5 tok/s | 1.4 GB |\n| Llama 3.2 3B Q4 | 100% | 10.8 tok/s | 2.4 GB |\n| Phi-3.5 Mini Q4 | 85.7% | 11.0 tok/s | 3.1 GB |\n| Qwen2.5 0.5B Q8 | 95.2% | 46.5 tok/s | 0.97 GB |\n| Qwen2.5 0.5B Q4 | 85.7% | 50.0 tok/s | 0.79 GB |\n| Qwen2.5 0.5B Q4 + Q4 KV | 19.1% | 49.4 tok/s | 0.78 GB |\n\nQ8 KV stayed close to F16 on most models, but Q4 KV destroyed quality on the\n0.5B model. The token-saver preset inherited that Q4 KV risk (19.1%), while\nbalanced and quality presets stayed at 85.7%. This is why presets are\nbenchmark-first, not automatic. Speed figures are single-run medians and move\nbenchmarks/run.mjs:278:          seed: spec.seed ?? 42,\nbenchmarks/run.mjs:354:    seed: spec.seed ?? 42,\nbenchmarks/matrix.mjs:38:    seed = 42,\nbenchmarks/matrix.mjs:89:    seed,\nbenchmarks/matrix.mjs:269:  seed: 42,","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"86a4f7fa-d622-43e3-bcc6-f332c0038b8d","timestamp":"2026-10-30T15:04:50.089Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## AI benchmark gate\n\nToken speed alone is not enough. ModelDuck ships a deterministic two-phase\nbenchmark that runs the real `LlamaEngine`:\n\n1. **Model reload phase** (`npm run bench:model`) compares model files,\n   quantization, KV cache, context size, batch size, thread pool, sequences,\n| Candidate | Quality | Speed | Memory |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Qwen2.5 Coder 1.5B Q4 | 95.2% | 22.5 tok/s | 1.4 GB |\n| Llama 3.2 3B Q4 | 100% | 10.8 tok/s | 2.4 GB |\n| Phi-3.5 Mini Q4 | 85.7% | 11.0 tok/s | 3.1 GB |\n| Qwen2.5 0.5B Q8 | 95.2% | 46.5 tok/s | 0.97 GB |\n| Qwen2.5 0.5B Q4 | 85.7% | 50.0 tok/s | 0.79 GB |\n| Qwen2.5 0.5B Q4 + Q4 KV | 19.1% | 49.4 tok/s | 0.78 GB |\n\nQ8 KV stayed close to F16 on most models, but Q4 KV destroyed quality on the\n0.5B model. The token-saver preset inherited that Q4 KV risk (19.1%), while\nbalanced and quality presets stayed at 85.7%. This is why presets are\nbenchmark-first, not automatic. Speed figures are single-run medians and move\nbenchmarks/run.mjs:278:          seed: spec.seed ?? 42,\nbenchmarks/run.mjs:354:    seed: spec.seed ?? 42,\nbenchmarks/matrix.mjs:38:    seed = 42,\nbenchmarks/matrix.mjs:89:    seed,\nbenchmarks/matrix.mjs:269:  seed: 42,","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7ed1e529-0acb-4345-882b-ea56623d3b14","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck","root":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck","branch":"master","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":16,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"AegeanWorks/AIKit","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"AegeanWorks/NeuroCore","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"AegeanWorks/Research-Engine","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"AegeanWorks/Aegean-Licensing","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"AegeanWorks/Aegean-Licensing-Ops","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"AegeanWorks/Merklock","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck","platform":"windows"}},"sandboxed":fals